* ============================================================
* WORKSPACE LOAD X64 CANARY
* ============================================================
* Purpose:
*   Canonical x64 workspace-load smoke with explicit environment bootstrap.
*
* Safety:
*   Read-only.
* ============================================================

SET ECHO ON
ECHO WORKSPACE LOAD x64 canary

DO ..\..\X64
WORKSPACE LOAD x64.dtschemas
WORKSPACE
AREA
DBAREAS
STATUS

WORKSPACE CLOSE
WORKSPACE
